{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sushi Bar | \u5bff\u53f8\u30d0\u30fc</strong> is a Japanese-style horror game where you play as a sushi chef working the night shift.\u00a0The playtime is an hour to hour and a half. There are two endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sushi-Making Gameplay</strong>:\u00a0Embrace the role of a sushi chef as you prepare a variety of dishes like sashimi, sushi rolls, and other Japanese dishes. Follow simple steps to chop and roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theme</strong>: Unique VHS-style aesthetic. The game\u2019s visuals feature grainy textures, color distortion, and subtle static effects that evoke the nostalgia of old-school horror films. Combined with dim lighting and flickering neon, the VHS style enhances the unsettling ambiance. (VHS can be turned off in settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Japanese City Vibe</strong>: Step into the heart of a bustling yet eerie Japanese cityscape, where neon signs glow softly against shadowy alleyways, and the distant hum of traffic fades into the night. The game\u2019s setting captures the essence of a quiet Osaka neighborhood, complete with narrow streets, paper lanterns and rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Atmosphere</strong>: Experience the haunting ambiance of a quiet sushi bar illuminated by flickering neon lights, with sounds of the city fading into a sinister silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Horror</strong>: Piece together the bar\u2019s dark secrets through cryptic notes and unsettling encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369850?t=1767557353","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro